<urn:atm:triage:RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ> a triage:Finding ;
    triage:findingId "RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ" ;
    triage:title "Duplicated case-shape literal tables" ;
    triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent found the case-shape literal tables used by the HTTP fuzz probes are duplicated rather than sharing one definition, in crates/atm-http-runtime (probe/harness code added in commits 4c1dada21/daae40656 on feature/an15-http-fuzz-campaign). Consolidate to a single source of truth." ;
    triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
    triage:category "code-quality" ;
    triage:phaseId "phase-an" ;
    triage:severity "minor" ;
    triage:repeatable false ;
    triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
    triage:status "fixed" ;
    triage:dispatchReady true ;
    triage:triagedAt "2026-08-15T04:16:42Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    triage:foundIn triage:AN.15 ;
    triage:foundAt "2026-08-15T04:16:42Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    triage:openOn <urn:atm:triage:worktree:feature-an15-http-fuzz-campaign> ;
    triage:resolutionNotes "Update 2026-08-15 by quality-mgr, AN15HTTPFUZZ-QA-2: fix commit 9681de8a5 independently verified via ruthless-boundary-qa. New shared const AN15_HTTP_CASE_SHAPES + helper an15_http_case_shape() (message_handler.rs, ~line 965-981) replaces the three separately-duplicated inline match tables previously at lines 954/996/1040, now a single source of truth consumed by all three message_handler.rs probes. NOTE (non-blocking, out of this record's cited scope): reviewer observed lib.rs's differential-probe (RBQA-F004-AN15HTTPFUZZ) still declares its own separate inline shape-label table rather than sharing this const; left open for a future dedicated triage pass since its shapes are semantically different and this record's 3 cited occurrences are all in message_handler.rs and are now consolidated. Closing this record as scoped." ;
    triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ:occurrence:1> ;
    triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ:occurrence:2> ;
    triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:RBP-F001-AN15HTTPFUZZ:occurrence:3> .

